  | pose proof tl_apart as (_ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & _ & X & _); unfold SEGTOP_A in *; destruct X; lia
  | pose proof tl_apart as (_ & _ & _ & _ & _ & X & _); unfold apart in X; destruct X; lia
